{
 "id": 99375,
 "name": "Dataset Exchange Working Group",
 "is_closed": false,
 "creation-date": "2017-05-04",
 "description": "<p>The mission of the Dataset Exchange Working Group is to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Develop a W3C Recommendation for the interoperable exchange on the Web of information on datasets at the variable level (Variable Description Vocabulary, VVD).</li>\n<li>Maintain and revise the RDF Data Cube Vocabulary, QB, taking into account feature requests from the QB user community.</li>\n<li>Maintain and revise the Data Catalog Vocabulary, DCAT, taking into account feature requests from the DCAT user community.</li>\n<li>Define and publish guidance on the specification and use of application profiles when requesting and serving data on the Web.</li>\n</ul>",
